      "widgets_values": [
        "男主：What did you say?\n男二：She's at the hospital.She lost too much blood and needs a transfusion.\n男二：What are you waiting for?There isn't enough blood.Heidi and Nicolehave the same blood type, right?Make her donate blood right away.\n男主：Isn't there any other way?Heidi just got injured.\n男二：What are you talking about?Heidi is just your admirer.Why do you care about her?\n女主：Let's go.I'll donate my blood.\n女主：If Nicole dies,I won't be able to complete my mission.\n男主：I clearly care about Nicole the most.But why is my heart aching like this?Right.It's guilt.She saved me just now.It's only natural that I feel sorry for her.\n男主：That's enough.How much more do you need?Isn't that too much?\n女主：Don't worry.The doctor knows what he's doing.It won't affect the surgery in two days.\n男主：I'm not worried about the surgery.\n女二：It's done.Since you've donated blood,you should get some rest,eat well and avoid strenuous activities.\n女主：Thanks.I'm tired.I'm going back to my room.Go and take care of Ms. Oz.\n男主：She does all this willingly.But why do I feel bad for her?\n\n",
